WEBVTT

00:04.771 --> 00:11.973
Kashimashi
~Girl Meets Girl~

00:13.146 --> 00:19.881
No matter where
you are, I'll find you.

00:21.287 --> 00:28.318
I can only watch you...
I can't even talk to you.

00:28.428 --> 00:32.888
Today is going to end,
and we can't see tomorrow.

00:33.466 --> 00:36.094
But they'll turn into a gentle color.

00:37.737 --> 00:44.199
It whirls down from
the sky... Love will shine.

00:44.677 --> 00:52.709
<i>When I turn around,
I always see your smile.</i>

00:54.020 --> 01:01.426
1 wish a day like that would come.

01:01.661 --> 01:09.500
I want to keep
looking at you up close.

01:10.270 --> 01:16.732
I'm sending these great
feelings that never end...

01:16.943 --> 01:21.903
...straight to you.

01:52.579 --> 01:53.944
There we go.

01:54.047 --> 01:56.277
Hazumu, will this be okay?

01:56.382 --> 01:57.940
Yeah, thanks.

01:58.118 --> 02:00.916
All we need is to add
some fertilizer and...

02:01.421 --> 02:02.388
Huh?

02:02.889 --> 02:04.220
A strawberry?

02:04.357 --> 02:07.326
The gardening club planted that.

02:07.494 --> 02:10.520
They didn't grow that well this year...

02:10.663 --> 02:11.789
Pretty...

02:12.332 --> 02:13.299
Want one?

02:13.399 --> 02:14.366
Can I?

02:21.207 --> 02:23.903
It's sour but still delicious.

02:24.277 --> 02:25.244
Right?

02:25.512 --> 02:26.479
Here.

02:27.380 --> 02:28.608
We'll share.

02:29.449 --> 02:30.416
Okay...

02:34.154 --> 02:35.849
It's sour!

02:56.042 --> 03:00.502
Girl Triangle

03:06.886 --> 03:08.854
It's finally happening.

03:09.022 --> 03:11.490
This is what
the premonition was about.

03:11.658 --> 03:15.856
I, Namiko Tsuki... 35 years old
and never had a boyfriend.

03:15.962 --> 03:19.454
So it's true! There is
a special someone after all!

03:21.501 --> 03:22.468
No...

03:22.669 --> 03:24.466
I'm a teacher.

03:25.004 --> 03:28.735
I shouldn't be feeling
this way in a place like this.

03:29.209 --> 03:33.145
But no one can prevent
me from falling in love!

03:33.346 --> 03:36.577
Can't stop falling in love!

03:39.886 --> 03:43.344
Everyone! I'm here
to introduce someone!

03:43.656 --> 03:47.649
He will be our assistant
teacher starting today.

03:51.497 --> 03:54.830
Let me introduce myself.
My name is Hitoshi Sora.

03:54.934 --> 03:57.869
1 will be the assistant
teacher for this class.

03:57.971 --> 04:00.940
I'll be in charge of biology.
Nice to meet you all.

04:01.040 --> 04:04.703
Mr. Sora is a relative of Hazumu.

04:04.844 --> 04:07.904
Be nice and listen to
what he says, okay?

04:09.616 --> 04:10.640
Relative?

04:10.917 --> 04:12.384
Ah, yeah...

04:16.723 --> 04:17.690
Wait!

04:18.758 --> 04:21.124
What's going on? This is bad...

04:22.629 --> 04:25.496
To observe the confined
environment called school...

04:25.598 --> 04:27.498
...this would be the perfect way.

04:27.600 --> 04:28.300
But...

04:28.301 --> 04:29.734
But...
Sister Brother!

04:30.570 --> 04:31.559
Jun Puu!

04:32.372 --> 04:36.809
Don't worry. Others can't see her.
No one will find out my true identity.

04:36.909 --> 04:39.935
So you can just go on
with your everyday life.

04:40.647 --> 04:42.205
Just go on...

04:42.382 --> 04:44.179
Come on, please?

04:44.284 --> 04:48.721
I really want the sound of your
flute in it. Can you do it for us?

04:48.821 --> 04:49.685
No...

04:49.789 --> 04:52.622
Come on. He's begging you to do it.

04:52.892 --> 04:54.553
Ah, um...

04:54.994 --> 04:56.427
But you know...

04:56.996 --> 04:58.361
Are you listening?

04:59.032 --> 05:02.160
<i>I'm sorry. I just don't
have the confidence...</i>

05:03.670 --> 05:04.659
Hazumu!

05:05.972 --> 05:06.802
Yasuna...

05:07.173 --> 05:09.664
Do you want to go to the library?

05:09.776 --> 05:10.470
Okay.

05:10.710 --> 05:11.734
Yasuna!

05:12.278 --> 05:13.312
Are you sure?

05:13.313 --> 05:14.439
Are you sure?
Yeah.

05:18.551 --> 05:22.419
<i>Guess it's no use...
Did I say something wrong?</i>

05:22.655 --> 05:24.816
No, it's not like that...

05:24.924 --> 05:25.788
It's just...

05:25.892 --> 05:27.018
It's just?

05:27.727 --> 05:29.991
She's very immature...

05:36.202 --> 05:37.169
Puu...

05:43.576 --> 05:45.544
Looks like the gym is full.

05:45.645 --> 05:47.112
I knew it.

05:47.313 --> 05:48.780
Practice is off?

05:48.948 --> 05:51.781
Of course not.
Strength training in the school.

05:51.884 --> 05:53.485
Ten laps up and down the stairs!

05:53.486 --> 05:54.714
Ten laps up and down the stairs!
What?

05:54.821 --> 05:56.948
Stop complaining and do it!

05:57.123 --> 05:58.590
Okay...

06:10.570 --> 06:11.798
Heading home?

06:11.904 --> 06:16.500
Yeah. But Hazumu
forgot something, so I'm waiting.

06:18.010 --> 06:20.774
I see. I see. Well, it's just...

06:20.880 --> 06:24.976
<i>I saw you staring at the sky,
so I was kind of worried...</i>

06:26.452 --> 06:28.920
Thanks for worrying about me.

06:30.323 --> 06:31.847
No problem...

06:32.091 --> 06:33.058
Bye...

06:33.726 --> 06:34.693
Goodbye.

06:35.228 --> 06:36.286
Oh yeah.

06:39.665 --> 06:41.758
Hazumu was happy.

06:43.603 --> 06:46.401
Since you and Hazumu
became friends again.

06:47.006 --> 06:47.973
Yeah.

06:48.074 --> 06:53.205
The bum tells me everything.
Seemed very happy too.

06:53.479 --> 06:54.446
I see.

06:54.981 --> 06:57.142
Well, just get along.

06:57.550 --> 06:59.882
I'm sure you two
went through a lot...

07:00.686 --> 07:02.984
<i>No, I meant emotionally...</i>

07:03.089 --> 07:06.490
<i>But I was the one responsible...</i>

07:06.859 --> 07:13.355
Hazumu talking about wanting
to be friends also made me happy.

07:16.969 --> 07:20.632
Oh, I see...
Then I have nothing to say.

07:21.040 --> 07:22.735
Thanks for waiting!

07:23.509 --> 07:25.067
Huh? Tomari.

07:25.178 --> 07:29.114
See you later. Try not
to keep people waiting, Hazumu.

07:29.215 --> 07:30.341
Okay...

07:30.583 --> 07:32.847
Good luck with practice!

07:32.985 --> 07:33.952
Thanks.

07:44.864 --> 07:46.798
Know a good place, Yasuna?

07:46.899 --> 07:49.527
Let's see... How about over there?

07:49.635 --> 07:51.000
Miss Kurusu!

07:51.938 --> 07:53.405
Everyone's waiting...

07:53.506 --> 07:54.734
Okay...

07:55.107 --> 07:57.007
All right! Let's do it!

08:05.852 --> 08:07.319
Wow!

08:08.054 --> 08:09.681
So cute!

08:10.957 --> 08:12.982
I've always wanted one like this.

08:13.092 --> 08:17.620
<i>You like flowers and plants,
so I thought you might like it.</i>

08:17.797 --> 08:19.162
Yeah, thanks!

08:19.665 --> 08:21.599
<i>Even if I asked Tomari...</i>

08:21.701 --> 08:25.865
...she'd say, "Just pick
something out and buy it."

08:26.005 --> 08:29.873
I don't really know where
I can find certain clothes for girls.

08:31.110 --> 08:32.805
Want to try it on?

08:32.912 --> 08:36.348
<i>Let's see... I guess you're a size 9...</i>

08:42.622 --> 08:45.955
Cute! As I thought,
it looks good on you.

08:46.292 --> 08:47.919
Really?

08:48.060 --> 08:49.186
Yes.

08:53.766 --> 08:54.494
Well?

08:54.600 --> 08:56.898
It's a bit cold, but I'm fine.

08:57.003 --> 08:59.494
Sorry for making you come with me.

08:59.605 --> 09:00.663
It's okay.

09:00.773 --> 09:03.708
I liked the clothes
at that store, and beside that...

09:03.943 --> 09:08.903
I've always wanted to switch to regular
clothes on the way home after school.

09:14.020 --> 09:16.580
They're wearing
matching clothes too.

09:16.689 --> 09:18.816
I guess they're lovers.

09:18.991 --> 09:19.980
Yeah...

09:22.061 --> 09:27.021
Do we look like that?
Like lovers, that is...

09:33.272 --> 09:37.072
I'm sorry. What am I saying...

09:37.243 --> 09:39.302
Man, my throat hurts!

09:39.478 --> 09:40.979
You scream too much.

09:40.980 --> 09:42.572
<i>You scream too much.
I want to sometimes.</i>

09:42.682 --> 09:43.774
Natsuko...

09:44.550 --> 09:45.574
A friend?

09:45.685 --> 09:48.085
Yeah. She's in the brass band...

09:49.755 --> 09:51.313
Karaoke

09:52.925 --> 09:55.359
Karaoke? You want to go there?

09:55.461 --> 09:57.929
What? No, it's just that...

09:58.531 --> 10:01.295
I've never been there before...

10:03.369 --> 10:04.393
13...

10:05.037 --> 10:06.026
14...

10:08.040 --> 10:09.234
15...

10:10.776 --> 10:14.075
16... 17...

10:15.047 --> 10:16.412
18...

10:24.190 --> 10:25.555
Amazing!

10:26.292 --> 10:27.554
Wow...

10:28.027 --> 10:30.154
I didn't know it was this small...

10:30.262 --> 10:35.029
Yeah. Tomari and the others
brought me here once before...

10:35.434 --> 10:36.492
ll see.

10:36.669 --> 10:41.732
But when we got inside, Tomari and
Ayuki kept grabbing the mic, and...

10:41.907 --> 10:43.204
Yay!

10:43.643 --> 10:47.204
Tomari kept on screaming
as she sang her rock songs...

10:48.314 --> 10:52.478
<i>...and Ayuki was singing enka medleys
while Asuta and I sat listening.</i>

10:52.785 --> 10:54.776
I'm scared!

10:55.087 --> 10:58.454
<i>So I always wanted to try this.</i>

11:00.593 --> 11:02.527
You pick songs from this, right?

11:02.628 --> 11:03.253
Yeah.

11:03.396 --> 11:06.797
And you enter the number
with this remote and...

11:07.266 --> 11:10.565
Order received for
the special banana honey toast.

11:10.670 --> 11:12.570
<i>What? I don't want that!</i>

11:12.672 --> 11:14.731
Let's see... Cancel, cancel...

11:15.041 --> 11:16.008
There.

11:16.275 --> 11:19.711
Additional order received for
the special banana honey toast.

11:19.812 --> 11:20.938
What?

11:21.781 --> 11:23.806
<i>What should I do?</i>

11:26.786 --> 11:28.754
Isn't this the button?

11:29.722 --> 11:32.054
Your order has been canceled.

11:32.158 --> 11:34.217
You're right. I'm glad...

11:34.493 --> 11:36.893
<i>This is what I want to sing.</i>

11:42.802 --> 11:44.997
I... I'm sorry!

11:45.304 --> 11:46.794
It's okay.

11:48.107 --> 11:50.234
The song's starting, Hazumu.

11:50.609 --> 11:51.633
You're right.

11:51.744 --> 11:52.802
Let's see...

12:03.856 --> 12:05.517
S-Sorry...

12:06.459 --> 12:08.984
It's okay. This is the second time...

12:09.462 --> 12:13.455
That time, you were still a boy...

12:14.200 --> 12:15.167
But...

12:22.007 --> 12:23.941
It started raining again...

12:30.416 --> 12:32.441
1 hate this rain.

12:43.195 --> 12:45.163
Thank you for dinner.

13:02.882 --> 13:06.648
We have to start singing...
Where's the mic?

13:11.390 --> 13:13.358
<i>What am I thinking?</i>

13:14.260 --> 13:17.320
Hazumu is a girl now.

13:18.697 --> 13:20.028
Hazumu?

13:23.335 --> 13:26.327
Nice facial expression...
Yes! Yes! Amazing!

13:26.438 --> 13:28.429
Great! Excellent!

13:39.518 --> 13:41.383
Oh! Venus!

13:41.887 --> 13:44.151
What are you thinking? Stupid old fart!

13:44.256 --> 13:46.417
Art... It's for art!

13:46.625 --> 13:48.718
You perverted tanuki...

14:04.877 --> 14:07.243
<i>What am I thinking?</i>

14:07.379 --> 14:08.971
Sister Brother!

14:09.081 --> 14:12.050
You're bright red! Looks interesting!

14:12.151 --> 14:14.642
Jun Puu, hey...

14:14.820 --> 14:16.185
Is it love?

14:16.522 --> 14:18.888
What? Love?

14:19.091 --> 14:22.060
The night sky after rain.
Lost in thought...

14:22.161 --> 14:24.652
The former boy and current girl.

14:24.797 --> 14:26.492
Deep sigh.

14:26.866 --> 14:28.663
Blushing cheeks.

14:28.868 --> 14:31.029
So who's the other party?

14:31.470 --> 14:32.994
Why are you...

14:33.305 --> 14:35.466
I'm the one asking questions.

14:35.608 --> 14:36.597
I'm not!

14:36.909 --> 14:38.740
I'm not in love!

14:38.878 --> 14:39.902
It's just...

14:40.179 --> 14:41.111
Hazumu!

14:41.280 --> 14:42.804
Tomari's here!

14:45.351 --> 14:47.148
What's wrong, Tomari?

14:47.419 --> 14:49.979
Sorry for showing up all of a sudden.

14:50.089 --> 14:53.081
I found this when
I was cleaning my room.

14:53.559 --> 14:56.790
I borrowed it for
such a long time, so...

14:57.329 --> 15:00.890
Thanks. You could've
given it to me any day.

15:01.200 --> 15:04.465
Well, I was just in the area, so...

15:04.570 --> 15:07.198
Want to come in?
Mr. Sora's here though.

15:07.306 --> 15:09.740
<i>No, it's okay. I have to go home...</i>

15:11.043 --> 15:11.743
Um...

15:11.744 --> 15:13.302
Um...
Hey, Tomari.

15:13.412 --> 15:14.811
What is it?

15:14.914 --> 15:17.212
Let's go buy some clothes sometime.

15:17.316 --> 15:18.283
What?

15:18.484 --> 15:21.453
Yasuna introduced me
to this clothing store.

15:22.588 --> 15:23.953
I see...

15:24.590 --> 15:26.717
You went today with Kamiizumi?

15:26.825 --> 15:28.918
Yeah. Right after school.

15:29.862 --> 15:31.420
Were you okay?

15:32.831 --> 15:36.289
Well, you know, you always
seem to hang on to the past...

15:36.402 --> 15:39.633
So maybe you kind of felt
awkward being with her.

15:39.805 --> 15:41.898
Oh, right, it's okay.

15:43.175 --> 15:45.109
It was fun...

15:49.882 --> 15:50.849
Tomari?

15:51.850 --> 15:54.011
Well, see you tomorrow.

16:25.517 --> 16:26.609
Hazumu.

16:27.586 --> 16:28.917
I wonder...

16:29.688 --> 16:31.519
...what happened today.

16:32.925 --> 16:34.893
<i>Why am I worried?</i>

16:36.929 --> 16:38.362
Ayuki!

16:38.897 --> 16:40.762
What are you doing this late?

16:40.866 --> 16:42.891
What about you?

16:43.002 --> 16:44.169
Taking a walk.

16:44.169 --> 16:45.329
Taking a walk.
A walk?

16:45.437 --> 16:49.703
It's really nice. Especially
when there's no one around...

16:50.843 --> 16:53.073
You get to see things clearly.

16:53.512 --> 16:55.275
I'm going home.

16:55.414 --> 16:57.507
There are only two choices.

16:59.651 --> 17:01.915
Either get on the stage...

17:02.021 --> 17:03.886
...or get off it.

17:24.376 --> 17:26.367
Sorry to keep you waiting!

17:28.514 --> 17:30.277
We need to bring umbrellas.

17:30.382 --> 17:31.349
Yeah.

17:40.893 --> 17:41.917
Let's go.

17:42.027 --> 17:42.994
Okay.

17:47.733 --> 17:49.894
There are only two choices.

17:51.503 --> 17:53.801
Either get on the stage...

17:55.507 --> 17:57.236
...or get off it.

18:17.296 --> 18:19.560
Hazumu, do you remember?

18:21.333 --> 18:23.392
When we first started school...

18:24.136 --> 18:29.870
Back then, this place used to be
a desolate roof with a tiny flower bed.

18:34.880 --> 18:38.475
You can see this place
clearly from the music room.

18:42.988 --> 18:46.549
One day during practice,
I noticed something.

18:47.659 --> 18:50.253
It was getting greener every day.

18:50.362 --> 18:53.195
Someone was making
the flower bed bigger.

18:54.766 --> 18:57.234
I was watching the whole time.

18:57.636 --> 19:02.369
I was watching that person as the
leaves turned color over the seasons.

19:04.243 --> 19:06.973
And that person was you, Hazumu.

19:07.412 --> 19:11.007
You have the power to make
the world a beautiful place.

19:11.116 --> 19:14.608
<i>I thought you had
the most beautiful heart.</i>

19:15.921 --> 19:17.786
That's not true.

19:18.123 --> 19:19.249
Hazumu...

19:25.464 --> 19:26.931
What is it?

19:29.268 --> 19:31.896
<i>There's something I want to tell you.</i>

19:33.705 --> 19:36.435
<i>I know this may sound crazy to you.</i>

19:36.775 --> 19:40.211
I also know that ll don't have
the right to say such a thing.

19:40.812 --> 19:42.245
Yasuna...

19:43.315 --> 19:45.146
But last night...

19:45.350 --> 19:48.410
No, I've been thinking
about it for a long time.

19:48.520 --> 19:51.080
I was thinking about you...

19:53.025 --> 19:55.550
I love you, Hazumu!

19:57.429 --> 19:59.829
But I'm already a...

20:34.099 --> 20:36.260
Hazumu!

20:42.641 --> 20:44.006
Yasuna...

20:46.211 --> 20:47.439
Tomari!

20:52.317 --> 20:53.682
This is bad.

20:53.785 --> 20:56.185
This is bad! This is bad!

20:57.122 --> 20:59.590
I'm so stupid. What did I do?

20:59.691 --> 21:01.659
<i>What did I just do?</i>

21:02.995 --> 21:05.054
<i>Why did I do that?</i>

21:06.198 --> 21:07.460
I..

21:08.166 --> 21:09.531
I..

21:29.888 --> 21:31.287
You...

21:31.556 --> 21:33.217
I'm sorry.

21:34.760 --> 21:35.727
But...

21:36.595 --> 21:40.395
I love Hazumu.

21:42.034 --> 21:43.661
I really do.

21:52.678 --> 21:53.906
Yasuna.

21:54.746 --> 21:57.806
You turned
Hazumu down once, right?

21:59.518 --> 22:02.316
You hurt Hazumu's
feelings, didn't you?

22:34.152 --> 22:39.920
If it's a never-ending road...

22:40.592 --> 22:46.997
...then I can see you again someday.

22:47.099 --> 22:52.833
You're a weakling who tries
to hide things with your kindness.

22:53.472 --> 23:00.071
I'm sorry for making you look that way.

23:01.580 --> 23:07.678
Looking for the truth...
I was searching for...

23:08.286 --> 23:14.885
...the blue sky since that time.

23:16.294 --> 23:22.494
Let's overcome
the sadness and be happy.

23:22.734 --> 23:29.162
<i>Should I put my trust
in a future that I can't see?</i>

23:29.307 --> 23:35.268
<i>Your smiley face is about to cry...
I promise to turn it into something bright.</i>

23:35.747 --> 23:42.744
Don't let go of this hand.

23:45.457 --> 23:49.689
Our future is just around the corner.

23:56.201 --> 23:58.226
It was like this for a long time.

23:58.336 --> 24:02.500
<i>Half the world was always empty,
and I was always alone.</i>

24:03.041 --> 24:05.373
Next time on Kashimashi
~Girl Meets Girl~.

24:05.477 --> 24:07.411
The Things Reflected in Yasuna's Eyes.

24:07.512 --> 24:09.776
These feelings... in my heart.
